    {
      "name": "6. Resilience (manual: stop a service first)",
      "description": "**Manual folder. Do not include it in automated runs.** Each request expects a service to be stopped first. Run the steps one by one.\n\nStop a single service (kills the JVM listening on its port):\n\n    lsof -ti tcp:8082 -sTCP:LISTEN | xargs kill     # inventory-service\n    lsof -ti tcp:8080 -sTCP:LISTEN | xargs kill     # product-service\n\nBring everything back (only missing components are started):\n\n    ./launch.sh\n\nSteps:\n1. Stop inventory-service, run **6.1** five or more times, then **6.2**: the circuit breaker is OPEN.\n2. Stop product-service and run **6.3** (gateway answers 503) and **6.4** (public route answers 401, a known gap).\n3. Run `./launch.sh`, wait 5 s, run folder 4 → *Place order (in stock)* 3 times, then **6.5**: the breaker moves OPEN → HALF_OPEN → CLOSED.\n\nCircuit breaker settings (order-service): count-based window of 5 calls, opens at 50% failures (minimum 5 calls), stays open 5 s, then allows 3 trial calls in HALF_OPEN.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6.1 [inventory down] Place order → fast 500 via fallback",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/order",
              "host": [
                "{{gatewayUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "order"
              ]
            },
            "description": "inventory-service is stopped. The InventoryClient call fails, the `@CircuitBreaker` fallback returns `false` (\"not in stock\"), and order-service answers 500. Because the fallback swallows the error, `@Retry` does not retry, so the answer comes back in milliseconds instead of hanging. order-service logs `Cannot get inventory for skuCode ...`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"skuCode\": \"{{inStockSku}}\",\n  \"price\": 999.99,\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 500', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(500); });",
                  "pm.test('Fails fast (under 2 s)', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6.2 [inventory down] Circuit breaker is OPEN",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/circuitbreakers",
              "host": [
                "{{orderServiceUrl}}"
